"被破","evidence":["zhouyu-e-o003c-q"]}],"place":null,"time":{"label":"孙策东渡时","precision":"undated","basis":"保留本条时间表达，不据相邻段落自动补年。","evidence":["zhouyu-e-o003c-q"]},"ordering_evidence":"zhouyu-e-o003c-q","source_order":[54,4,"O003c"],"order":9564}],"persons":[{"id":"zhouyu-p0006","name":"薛礼","evidence":["zhouyu-q-o003","sunshi-q-p037","yaoci-q-5279ba7b65486a4d9f3c","yaoci-q-4b8d6f838864c80dc332","yaoci-q2-718668cce7d1cf0a4d6d"],"facts":[],"aliases":[],"mentions":[{"id":"zhouyu-m-o003-zhouyu-p0006","kind":"mention","text":"文中提及","evidence":["zhouyu-q-o003"]},{"id":"sunshi-m-p037-zhouyu-p0006","kind":"mention","text":"文中提及","evidence":["sunshi-q-p037"]},{"id":"yaoci-m2-55333d48a3650602d7e3","kind":"mention","text":"文中提及","evidence":["yaoci-q-4b8d6f838864c80dc332"]}]}],"evidence":[{"id":"sunshi-e-p037b-q","section":"chapter-046","block":"b-8ad4a2f852325dd4ff74","layer":"pei","quote":"时彭城相薛礼、下邳相笮融，依繇为盟主；礼据秣陵城，融屯县南。策先攻融，融出兵交战；斩首五百余级，融即闭门，不敢动。因渡江攻礼，礼突走；","attribution":"《江表传》","section_title":"孙破虏讨逆传第一","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0099.xhtml","index":248,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":"n-6fa39d8ee05c62716a11","start":39,"end":106,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"sunshi-q-p037","section":"chapter-046","block":"b-8ad4a2f852325dd4ff74","layer":"pei","quote":"﹝二﹞《江表传》曰：“策渡江，攻繇牛渚营，尽得邸阁粮谷、战具。是岁兴平二年也。时彭城相薛礼、下邳相笮融，依繇为盟主；礼据秣陵城，融屯县南。策先攻融，融出兵交战；斩首五百余级，融即闭门，不敢动。因渡江攻礼，礼突走；而樊能、于麋等，复合众，袭夺牛渚屯。策闻之，还攻破能等，获男女万余人。复下攻融，为流矢所中，伤股；不能乘马，因自舆，还牛渚营。或叛告融曰：‘孙郎被箭，已死！’融大喜，即遣将于兹向策。策遣步骑数百挑战，设伏于后。贼出击之，锋刃未接而伪走；贼追入伏中，乃大破之，斩首千余级。策因往到融营下，令左右大呼曰：‘孙郎竟云何！’贼于是惊怖，夜遁。融闻策尚在，更深沟高垒，缮治守备。策以融所屯地势险固，乃舍去；攻破繇别将于海陵，转攻湖孰、江乘，皆下之。”","attribution":"《江表传》","section_title":"孙破虏讨逆传第一","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0099.xhtml","index":248,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":"n-6fa39d8ee05c62716a11","start":0,"end":326,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"yaoci-q-382e6f977a0712f3a961","section":"chapter-049","block":"b-b11e4525d5674fad5f88","layer":"original","quote":"笮融先至，﹝四﹞杀太守朱皓，﹝五﹞入居郡中","section_title":"刘繇太史慈士燮传第四","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0105.xhtml","index":4,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":44,"end":65,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"yaoci-q-4b8d6f838864c80dc332","section":"chapter-049","block":"b-66f2d52fde94a20ba685","layer":"original","quote":"过杀礼，然后杀皓","section_title":"刘繇太史慈士燮传第四","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0105.xhtml","index":7,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":84,"end":92,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"yaoci-q-5279ba7b65486a4d9f3c","section":"chapter-049","block":"b-66f2d52fde94a20ba685","layer":"original","quote":"先是，彭城相薛礼，为陶谦所逼，屯秣陵","section_title":"刘繇太史慈士燮传第四","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0105.xhtml","index":7,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":38,"end":56,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"yaoci-q-8fb1a9cbe7fe3073806a","section":"chapter-049","block":"b-0352ce76d13020899e82","layer":"pei","quote":"许子将谓繇曰：‘笮融出军，不顾（命）名义者也！朱文明，善推诚以信人，宜使密防之","attribution":"裴注·献帝春秋","section_title":"刘繇太史慈士燮传第四","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0105.xhtml","index":45,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":"n-f1c4a2446f35552ad79a","start":37,"end":76,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"yaoci-q-b27d7ae93a6d72b0d0aa","section":"chapter-049","block":"b-0352ce76d13020899e82","layer":"pei","quote":"融到，果诈杀皓，代领郡事","attribution":"裴注·献帝春秋","section_title":"刘繇太史慈士燮传第四","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0105.xhtml","index":45,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":"n-f1c4a2446f35552ad79a","start":78,"end":90,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"yaoci-q2-718668cce7d1cf0a4d6d","section":"chapter-049","block":"b-66f2d52fde94a20ba685","layer":"original","quote":"过杀礼，然后杀皓。","section_title":"刘繇太史慈士燮传第四","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0105.xhtml","index":7,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":84,"end":93,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"zhouyu-e-o003c-q","section":"chapter-054","block":"b-31b40d63d1cd4e25427e","layer":"original","quote":"乃渡江击秣陵，破笮融、薛礼。","section_title":"周瑜鲁肃吕蒙传第九","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0115.xhtml","index":3,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":51,"end":65,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"zhouyu-q-o003","section":"chapter-054","block":"b-31b40d63d1cd4e25427e","layer":"original","quote":"会策将东渡，到历阳；驰书报瑜，瑜将兵迎策。策大喜曰：“吾得卿，谐也〖7〗！”遂从攻横江、当利，皆拔之。乃渡江击秣陵，破笮融、薛礼。转下湖孰、江乘〖8〗，进入曲阿，刘繇奔走：而策之众已数万矣。因谓瑜曰：“吾以此众取吴、会，平山越，已足〖9〗。卿还镇丹杨。”瑜还。","section_title":"周瑜鲁肃吕蒙传第九","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0115.xhtml","index":3,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":130,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"}],"profiles":{},"directory_counts":{}}
